Task: Add text search filter to interactive search modals

Summary:
Added a text search input field to both MovieInteractiveSearchModal and SeriesInteractiveSearchModal components, allowing users to filter release results by title text.

Changes:
- Added searchQuery state variable to track the search input
- Added text input field with clear button (X icon) in the filter controls bar
- Updated filtering logic to include case-insensitive title search before quality/indexer filters
- Reset searchQuery to empty string when modal closes

Files Modified:
- app/src/components/movie/MovieInteractiveSearchModal.tsx
- app/src/components/series/SeriesInteractiveSearchModal.tsx

Why:
Users needed the ability to quickly find specific releases by searching for keywords in release titles, which is essential when dealing with large result sets from multiple indexers.
